OL,3,GNEWSADrivers disgusted by human waste
OL,4,Ain car park
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers who use a Hull city centre car
OL,7,Fpark are urging the council that owns
OL,8,Fit to do more to prevent anti-social
OL,9,Fbehaviour after human faeces and
OL,10,Fevidence of drug use were found.
OL,12,FOver the past month, human excrement
OL,13,Fhas been found at the George Street car
OL,14,Fpark multiple times near the doorway to
OL,15,Fthe main stairwell on the fourth floor.
OL,17,FHull City Council leader Mike Ross
OL,18,Fsaid: "Behaviour like this is
OL,19,Funacceptable and the council condemns
OL,20,Fit strongly. My message to anyone
OL,21,Fexperiencing it, or seeing it, is do
OL,22,Freport it."
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
